                <note rend="inline" type="source">837.51/921: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Representative on Special Mission in Cuba</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Crowder</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the
                        Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Habana</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1923-01-13T14:00:00-05:29"><hi rendition="#italic">January 13,
                                1923—2 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 5:23 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>5. Loan awarded to Morgan and Company by Presidential resolution today.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Crowder</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
